---
---

<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-primary animate-fadeIn">Često Postavljana Pitanja</h2>
    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">Odgovori na pitanja koja vas zanimaju o našim uslugama.</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-4 animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300 p-6 group cursor-pointer" open>
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">schedule</span>
            Koliko dugo traje tehnički pregled?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Tehnički pregled obično traje između 30 do 60 minuta, zavisno od stanja vozila i vrste pregleda koji je potreban. Naš brz i efikasan timje tu da obezbedi najbolje iskustvo.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300 p-6 group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary hover:text-accent transition">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl group-hover:rotate-12 transition duration-300">attach_money</span>
            Koja je cena pregleda?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Cena se razlikuje zavisno od vrste vozila, ali početna cena je od 2.500 dinara za osnovno pregled. Poseti našu stranicu sa cenama za detaljne informacije.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">event</span>
            Da li je potrebna rezervacija?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Preporučujem rezervaciju unapred kroz našu veb stranicu ili pozivom, ali primamo i bez zakazivanja zavisno od opterećenja. Unapredi rezervacija osigurava brže obavljanje pregleda.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">build</span>
            Šta ako vozilo ne prođe tehnički?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Daćemo vam detaljni izveštaj sa svim manjkavostima i preporukama za reparaciju. Naš tim može vam predložiti poznate servise koji mogu da reše probleme.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">access_time</span>
            Radno vrijeme?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Radimo od ponedjeljka do petka od 08:00 do 18:00, subotom od 09:00 do 15:00. Nedjeljom zatvoreni. Sve tri lokacije imaju identično radno vrijeme.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 group cursor-pointer">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-primary">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">verified</span>
            Jesu li vase sertifikate?
          </span>
          <span class="material-icons transition duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 ml-10">Svi naši tehničari su sertifikovani prema međunarodnim standardima i redovno se usavršavaju. Naša laboratorija je akreditirana od strane nadležnih vlasti.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Još pitanja?</p>
      <a href="/kontakt" class="inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-orange-500 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition transform hover:scale-105">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-icons">mail</span>
          Kontaktiraj nas
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
